{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify frontend and Liquid developer. Build a fully responsive custom Shopify section that 100% replicates the content layout, spacing, components, and structure shown in the references "image_b633df.jpg" and "image_b633ff.png".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration & Section Base Styles
    - **Theme Consistency:** The section must automatically inherit the current theme's typography variables (e.g., `var(--font-heading-family)`, `var(--font-body-family)`), standard maximum layout width (e.g., matching the theme's `.page-width` or `.container` wrappers), and native responsive side gutters.
    - **Section Background:** Clean, bright white background (#FFFFFF) with ample top and bottom section padding.
    - **Section Header (Left-Aligned):** 
      - Eyebrow text: "FEATURED CASE STUDIES" in small, muted, uppercase letters with generous letter spacing.
      - Main section title: "Enterprise-Scale Transformations" in large, bold, deep navy blue text.
    
    ### 2. Case Study Card Wrapper (Repeatable Block Structure)
    The layout relies on a stack of cards. Each card must be self-contained as a repeatable schema block (`block` in Liquid) with a light gray background/border, deep rounded corners (~16px), a clean white inner canvas, and a generous interior padding layout. 
    
    On desktop, the card interior splits into a 3-column layout (Column 1: Company Profile [approx. 30% width], Column 2: Performance Metrics & Challenges [approx. 40% width], Column 3: Operational Impact & CTA [approx. 30% width]). On mobile, these wrap cleanly into a stacked vertical format.
    
    ### 3. Card Inner Columns Content Breakdown
    
    #### Column 1: Company Profile (Left)
    - **Top Row Badges:** A horizontal inline arrangement containing:
      - A small, rounded light-green square badge featuring a line-art building/retail store icon.
      - An adjacent pill-shaped light-green text badge reading "FEATURED" in uppercase olive green font.
    - **Company Title:** Large, bold, deep navy text. 
    - **Metadata tags:** A line of small, muted gray text for category/tags separated by a middle dot (e.g., "Fashion • Enterprise Scale").
    - **Store Counter:** A prominent, small bold line showing location metrics (e.g., "124 → 220 stores" or "400 stores").
    - **Description:** A brief multi-line narrative paragraph in muted, clean gray text outlining the case background.
    
    #### Column 2: Performance Metrics & Challenges (Middle)
    - **Sub-block A: KEY RESULTS**
      - Section header: "KEY RESULTS" in small uppercase gray text.
      - List items: A vertical list where each item is prefixed with a small, upward-pointing lime-green trend line chart icon (`svg`).
    - **Sub-block B: CHALLENGES BEFORE FLOW**
      - Section header: "CHALLENGES BEFORE FLOW" in small uppercase gray text with top margin separation.
      - List items: A traditional bulleted list utilizing clean, small solid gray bullet points.
    
    #### Column 3: OPERATIONAL IMPACT & CTA (Right)
    - **Section header:** "OPERATIONAL IMPACT" in small uppercase gray text.
    - **Impact List:** A vertical list where each line item is prefixed with a distinctive lime/olive green bullseye/concentric circle icon (`svg`).
    - **Call to Action Button:** A full-width (or comfortably wide), deep navy blue button pinned to the bottom right of the card matrix.
      - Text: "Full Case Study →" in crisp white text.
      - Border radius: Slightly rounded corners (~6px to 8px).
    
    ---
    
    ### 4. Direct Text Content Map for Reference Replication
    Ensure your Shopify Liquid schema contains all exact textual strings copied from image_b633df.jpg and image_b633ff.png to support flawless content reproduction:
    
    #### Block 1 Copy (from image_b633df.jpg):
    - **Company Title:** Major Japanese Fashion Retailer
    - **Metadata / Stores:** Fashion • Enterprise Scale | 124 → 220 stores
    - **Description:** Faced declining visitor counts across 124 stores. Introduced Flow with POS integration to measure conversion in real time. After enabling store-level access and training, achieved dramatic business transformation.
    - **Key Results:**
      - Conversion improved 8.93%
      - Sales increased 8.25% = ¥1.8 billion additional revenue
      - ROI exceeded 50x (¥24,000/store/month cost)
      - Expanded to 220+ stores
    - **Challenges Before Flow:**
      - Year one: data only used at HQ, stores had no dashboard access
      - Little improvement when managers couldn't see data
      - Declining visitor counts due to external factors
    - **Operational Impact:**
      - Store level access to real-time data
      - Active training by Flow Success team
      - Shift from HQ-only analysis to collaborative data use
      - Cultural move toward data-driven decision making
      - Performance improves when store teams can turn measurement into daily execution
    
    #### Block 2 Copy (from top of image_b633ff.png):
    - **Company Title:** Daytona International
    - **Metadata / Stores:** Fashion • Multi-Brand | Multiple locations
    - **Description:** Operates multiple fashion and lifestyle brands. Deployed Flow to automate visitor counting and improve store-level KPI management across di
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-case-studies-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 80px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-case-studies-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-large, 40px);
  }

  .ai-case-studies-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-case-studies-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-case-studies-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1e316a;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f9fafb;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 30% 40% 30%;
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-badge-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    background-color: #d1fae5;
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    stroke: #059669;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-featured-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #d1fae5;
    color: #059669;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .ai-company-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-heading-family);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1e316a;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-metadata-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-store-count-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1e316a;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .ai-section-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-results-list-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-challenges-list-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-impact-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-results-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li,
  .ai-impact-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .ai-results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-impact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: #84cc16;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-impact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: #84cc16;
  }

  .ai-challenges-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .ai-challenges-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    background-color: #6b7280;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .ai-challenges-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .ai-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #1e316a;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: auto;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #152447;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
    .ai-case-study-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-case-studies-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-case-studies-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 0;
    }

    .ai-case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .ai-case-studies-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-company-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-case-studies-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-case-studies-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-case-studies-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.eyebrow_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-case-studies-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.eyebrow_text }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.section_title != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-case-studies-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_title }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-case-study-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-case-study-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-badge-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M3 21h18M3 7v13M21 7v13M5 3h14l2 4H3l2-4zM9 12h6M9 16h6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="ai-featured-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">FEATURED</span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="ai-company-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.company_name }}</h3>
          
          {% if block.settings.metadata != blank %}
            <div class="ai-metadata-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.metadata }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.store_count != blank %}
            <div class="ai-store-count-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.store_count }}</div>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
            <div class="ai-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-case-study-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-section-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">KEY RESULTS</div>
          <ul class="ai-results-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.result_1 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.result_1 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.result_2 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.result_2 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.result_3 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.result_3 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.result_4 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-results-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.result_4 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
          </ul>

          <div class="ai-challenges-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-section-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">CHALLENGES BEFORE FLOW</div>
            <ul class="ai-challenges-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if block.settings.challenge_1 != blank %}
                <li>{{ block.settings.challenge_1 }}</li>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.challenge_2 != blank %}
                <li>{{ block.settings.challenge_2 }}</li>
              {% endif %}
              {% if block.settings.challenge_3 != blank %}
                <li>{{ block.settings.challenge_3 }}</li>
              {% endif %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-case-study-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-section-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">OPERATIONAL IMPACT</div>
          <ul class="ai-impact-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if block.settings.impact_1 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-impact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.impact_1 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.impact_2 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-impact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.impact_2 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.impact_3 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-impact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.impact_3 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.impact_4 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-impact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.impact_4 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
            {% if block.settings.impact_5 != blank %}
              <li>
                <span class="ai-impact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/>
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                <span>{{ block.settings.impact_5 }}</span>
              </li>
            {% endif %}
          </ul>

          {% if block.settings.cta_url != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_url }}" class="ai-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.cta_text }} →
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

